:: Widgets Pirates [widget]
<<widget "pirate_watch">>
	<<if _args[0]>>
		<<if $pirate_watch is undefined>>
			<<set $pirate_watch to 0>>
		<</if>>
		<<set $pirate_watch += _args[0]>>
		<<set $pirate_watch to Math.clamp($pirate_watch, 0, 100)>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "pirate_status">>
	<<if _args[0]>>
		<<if $pirate_status is undefined>>
			<<set $pirate_status to 0>>
		<</if>>
		<<if _args[1] is "scum" and $pirate_rank isnot 0 or _args[1] is "mate" and $pirate_rank isnot 1>>
		<<else>>
			<<set $pirate_status += _args[0]>>
			<<set $pirate_status to Math.clamp($pirate_status, 0, 100)>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "pirate_clothes_up">>
	<<if $pirate_rank gte 1>>
		<<lowerwear "jeans">>
		<<upperwear "punk leather jacket">>
	<<else>>
		<<if $player.sex is "f" or $player.sex is "m" and $settings.forcedCrossdressingEnabled>>
			<<lowerwear "jean miniskirt">>
		<<else>>
			<<lowerwear "denim shorts">>
		<</if>>
		<<upperwear "tank top">>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "pirate_rescue">>
	<<if $pirate_rank gte 1>>
		<<enable_rescue>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "pirate_attention">>
	<<if _args[0]>>
		<<set $pirate_attention += _args[0]>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "pirate_attack_init">>
	<<set $pirate_attention to 0>>
	<<set $pirate_time to 0>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "pirate_attack_end">>
	<<unset $pirate_attention>>
	<<unset $pirate_time>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "pirate_mate_work">>
    <<if _args[0] is "deck">>
        <<set $phase to 0>><<wearProp "mop">>
        <<generateRole 0 0 "pirate">><<person1>>
        어떤 <<person>>【이가】 당신의 손에 대걸레를 쥐여준다. "가만히 서 있지만 말고. 갑판이나 닦아."
        <br><br>

        <<link [[갑판 닦기 (2:00)|Pirate Swab]]>><<endevent>><<pirate_status 1 "mate">><<pass 120>><<tiredness 6>><</link>><<gtiredness>><<grespect "mate">>
        <br>
        <<link [[거절한다|Pirate Work Refuse]]>><<handheldon>><</link>>
        <br>
    <<elseif _args[0] is "cabin">>
        <<set $phase to 1>>
        <<generateRole 0 0 "pirate">><<person1>>
        "이 쓰레기장 꼴 좀 보라고." <<person>>【이가】 말한다. <<He>>【은는】 이제야 당신을 발견한 것 같다. "너. 청소해, 안 그러면 네 엉덩이를 뱃머리에 처박아 버릴 테니까."
        <br><br>

        <<link [[선실 청소 (2:00)|Pirate Cabin Clean]]>><<pirate_status 1 "mate">><<pass 120>><<tiredness 6>><</link>><<gtiredness>><<grespect "mate">>
        <br>
        <<link [[거절한다|Pirate Work Refuse]]>><</link>>
        <br>
    <<elseif _args[0] is "bilge">>
        <<set $phase to 2>>
        <<generateRole 0 0 "pirate">><<person1>>
        "물이 새는 곳을 막아야 해." <<person>>【이가】 웅덩이를 넘어가며 말한다. "너. 당장 시작해."
        <br><br>

        <<link [[구멍 막기 (2:00)|Pirate Bilge Plug]]>><<pirate_status 1 "mate">><<pass 120>><<tiredness 6>><</link>><<gtiredness>><<grespect "mate">>
        <br>
        <<link [[거절한다|Pirate Work Refuse]]>><</link>>
        <br>
    <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "pirate_mate_work_end_links">>
    <<if $phase is 0>>
        <<link [[다음|Pirate Deck]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
        <br>
    <<elseif $phase is 1>>
        <<link [[다음|Pirate Cabin]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
        <br>
    <<else>>
        <<link [[다음|Pirate Bilge]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
        <br>
    <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "events_pirate_deck">>
